# Claire's Vercel project has apps/website as its Root Directory. Keep the
# upload focused on sources required for that build; this also prevents local
# dependency trees and native artifacts from exceeding Vercel's file limit.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/dist
# Keep every workspace's package.json. Without them, `bun install` re-resolves
# a smaller workspace than bun.lock describes and can split React: the website
# gets react@19.2.8 while react-dom hoists at 19.2.0, and the docs prebuild
# crashes. Builds with a warm cache hide this; a new branch hits it.
apps/client/*
!apps/client/package.json
apps/desktop/*
!apps/desktop/package.json
apps/server/*
!apps/server/package.json
docker
examples/*
!examples/plugins
examples/plugins/*/*
!examples/plugins/*/package.json
vendor
.agents
.codex
.vercel
apps/website/.vercel
